WeatherClient Methods
Method	Description	Returns
fetch()	Get current weather data	WeatherData
set_city(city)	Change current city	bool
get_cities()	List all available cities	List[str]
get_current_city()	Get current city name	str
WeatherData Attributes
Attribute	Type	Description	Range
temperature	float	Temperature in °C	-30 to 50
wind_speed	float	Wind speed in km/h	0 to 50
precipitation	float	Precipitation in mm	0 to 100
city	str	City name	-
temp_norm	float	Normalized temperature	0 to 1
wind_norm	float	Normalized wind speed	0 to 1
source	str	Data source	-
